{"id":23033,"author":"MrDogPT","body":"Hello again, Know that Avicus aren't accepting DTM anymore, I decided to create an CTW map.\u003cbr\u003eI just want to warn you something first:\u003cbr\u003eI don't know how to program stuff so the XML and the chests contain and everything aren't done.\u003cbr\u003eThe armor and the stuff that you start with aren't programed too.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eMap: Simply CTW\u003cbr\u003e56 Iron blocks for each team.\u003cbr\u003e2 Teams:\u003cbr\u003eLime vs Red\u003cbr\u003e2 Wools:\u003cbr\u003eLime- Yellow \u0026amp; Black\u003cbr\u003eRed- Orange \u0026amp; Green\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003ePhotos:\u0026nbsp;\u003ca href=\"http://imgur.com/a/jVDUl\" title=\"Link: http://imgur.com/a/jVDUl\"\u003ehttp://imgur.com/a/jVDUl\u003c/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003eI hope you guys understand that I make this maps because I like to do, I don't understand anything about making maps.\u003cbr\u003eI hope you like the idea and the map layout.\u003cbr\u003eRegards.\u003cbr\u003exToby","body_tagged":"Hello again, Know that Avicus aren't accepting DTM anymore, I decided to create an CTW map.\u003cbr\u003eI just want to warn you something first:\u003cbr\u003eI don't know how to program stuff so the XML and the chests contain and everything aren't done.\u003cbr\u003eThe armor and the stuff that you start with aren't programed too.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eMap: Simply CTW\u003cbr\u003e56 Iron blocks for each team.\u003cbr\u003e2 Teams:\u003cbr\u003eLime vs Red\u003cbr\u003e2 Wools:\u003cbr\u003eLime- Yellow \u0026amp; Black\u003cbr\u003eRed- Orange \u0026amp; Green\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003ePhotos:\u0026nbsp;\u003ca href=\"http://imgur.com/a/jVDUl\" title=\"Link: http://imgur.com/a/jVDUl\"\u003ehttp://imgur.com/a/jVDUl\u003c/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003eI hope you guys understand that I make this maps because I like to do, I don't understand anything about making maps.\u003cbr\u003eI hope you like the idea and the map layout.\u003cbr\u003eRegards.\u003cbr\u003exToby","created_at":1468100161,"title":"Simply CTW","replies":[{"id":316786,"author":"XtraMajestical","body":"It looks great mate, keep up the good work\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003e#TobyForMapDev\u003cbr\u003e#MakeAvicusGr8AgainWithTobysMaps\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eps; toby is rich and hired someone to build it for him","body_tagged":"It looks great mate, keep up the good work\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003e#TobyForMapDev\u003cbr\u003e#MakeAvicusGr8AgainWithTobysMaps\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eps; toby is rich and hired someone to build it for him","created_at":1468100940},{"id":316788,"author":"Lokigh","body":"Awesome!\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003ep.s: Toby is rich and got someone to build it for him","body_tagged":"Awesome!\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003ep.s: Toby is rich and got someone to build it for him","created_at":1468101567},{"id":316790,"author":"MrDogPT","body":"Nooo :(","body_tagged":"Nooo :(","created_at":1468101854},{"id":316957,"author":"MrDogPT","body":"Hey, I added stuff to the map.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eMore 153 Iron blocks for Each team,\u003cbr\u003eA Big path so atacker can go to the Wool room without passing tough the spawn.\u003cbr\u003eChest in spawn to defend ( don't contain anything yet ).\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca href=\"http://imgur.com/a/OkA3X\"\u003ehttp://imgur.com/a/OkA3X\u003c/a\u003e","body_tagged":"Hey, I added stuff to the map.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eMore 153 Iron blocks for Each team,\u003cbr\u003eA Big path so atacker can go to the Wool room without passing tough the spawn.\u003cbr\u003eChest in spawn to defend ( don't contain anything yet ).\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca href=\"http://imgur.com/a/OkA3X\"\u003ehttp://imgur.com/a/OkA3X\u003c/a\u003e","created_at":1468164694},{"id":316963,"author":"KojaCola","body":"Nice map!","body_tagged":"Nice map!","created_at":1468167434},{"id":317163,"author":"OldManTigerMask","body":"\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Helvetica, sans