tachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: \u0026quot;Segoe UI Symbol\u0026quot;, sans-serif; line-height: 14.98px;\"\u003e✓\u003c/span\u003e] Sufficient Recourses \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:10.5pt;line-height:107%;font-family:\u0026quot;Helvetica\u0026quot;,sans-serif;\r\ncolor:#333333\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\r\n\u003cspan style=\"background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\"\u003e[\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: \u0026quot;Segoe UI Symbol\u0026quot;, sans-serif; line-height: 14.98px;\"\u003e✓\u003c/span\u003e] Lag Free\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\r\nline-height:107%;font-family:\u0026quot;Helvetica\u0026quot;,sans-serif;color:#333333\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\r\n\u003cbr\u003e\r\n\u003cspan style=\"background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\"\u003eTips:\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\r\nline-height:107%;font-family:\u0026quot;Helvetica\u0026quot;,sans-serif;color:#333333\"\u003eDetail isn't really there unfortunately, this isn't mandatory but maybe add few layers around the border of the land and add layers to the wool rooms :P\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Helvetica, sans-serif\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 107%;\"\u003eLayers \u0026amp; Structure, well are limited however it is playable, I recommend adding more\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"line-height: 14.98px;\"\u003eobstacles.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 107%;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\r\nline-height:107%;font-family:\u0026quot;Helvetica\u0026quot;,sans-serif;color:#333333\"\u003eXML isn't done but you should state the Loadout and provide a download so a XML Developer will be able to code it.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\r\nline-height:107%;font-family:\u0026quot;Helvetica\u0026quot;,sans-serif;color:#333333\"\u003eThe gap between the two teams are very large, I suggest adding a mid island so the gap isn't large.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\r\nline-height:107%;font-family:\u0026quot;Helvetica\u0026quot;,sans-serif;color:#333333\"\u003e\r\n\u003cspan style=\"background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\"\u003eConclusion:\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\r\n\u003cspan style=\"background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\"\u003eThe map although may not fit correctly on my criteria however in the tips I provided above should give you a higher chance of this map being accepted! Please don't take this in a bad way, this map is amazing and it does have potential. Anyways I like the platforming at the front of the two teams.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\r\n\u003cbr\u003e\r\n\u003cspan style=\"background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\"\u003eThanks,\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\r\n\u003cspan style=\"background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\"\u003eTiger\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003co:p\u003e\u003c/o:p\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","body_tagged":"\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\"\u003eGreat\r\nMap!\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003e\r\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:10.5pt;line-height:107%;font-family:\u0026quot;Helvetica\u0026quot;,sans-serif;\r\ncolor:#333333\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\r\n\u003cspan style=\"background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\"\u003eWhat this map has on my Map Criteria:\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\r\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: black; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\"\u003e[\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.